================================================================================
                         THIRD-PARTY DEPENDENCY NOTICE
================================================================================

NO GPL DEPENDENCIES (as of 2026-06-23):
---------------------------------------
The compiled binaries link no GPL-licensed libraries. FFTW3 was replaced by a
permissive self-owned codelet FFT, and the GSL-based ensemble fitters were
removed in favour of a pure-NumPy implementation. The two C libraries
(libbulkxcorr2d, libfusedwarp) link only OpenMP and the C math library, so the
distribution is BSD-3-Clause throughout with no copyleft obligations.

PERMISSIVELY-LICENSED DEPENDENCIES:
-----------------------------------
  * NumPy - BSD 3-Clause
  * SciPy - BSD 3-Clause
  * OpenCV - Apache 2.0
  * And others (see NOTICE file for complete list)
